nside the colony, claiming the lives of Banagher's classmates.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-04-17","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/82lxPq71F0OfrBWXD6oTrkJsXpa.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/82lxPq71F0OfrBWXD6oTrkJsXpa.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/67524/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"2370408","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"After repulsing the Kshatriya, Banagher loses consciousness, and along with the Unicorn Gundam, he is retrieved by the Earth Federation Forces warship Nahel Argama. The ship has also rescued Audrey, as well as Takuya and Micott.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-04-24","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/g3q4HmJJNG5wCZ5VcKCpCwwoUp2.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/g3q4HmJJNG5wCZ5VcKCpCwwoUp2.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/67524/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"2370409","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Daguza has taken Mineva (or Audrey) hostage, but Frontal rejects his demand for a ceasefire and declares that he will sink the Nahel Argama. In order to save Audrey, Banagher sorties in the Unicorn Gundam.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-05-01","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/85E5d3OvpAzlWQPDIFFVzHzhYrk.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/85E5d3OvpAzlWQPDIFFVzHzhYrk.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/67524/season/1/episode/5"},{"id":"2370411","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Removing his mask and revealing his face, Frontal requests the cooperation of Banagher, who can activate the Unicorn Gundam. When Banagher refuses, Angelo berates him for killing one of his subordinates.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-05-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tN7oscJidZ5WOrYilW8VmggvHlJ.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tN7oscJidZ5WOrYilW8VmggvHlJ.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/67524/season/1/episode/6"},{"id":"2370413","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Together with the ECOAS special forces group, the Nahel Argama of the Earth Federation Forces' Londo Bell unit begins an operation to recapture Banagher and the Unicorn Gundam.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-05-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/GJvW9pT436FyNkugluylCHHVlB.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/GJvW9pT436FyNkugluylCHHVlB.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/67524/season/1/episode/7"},{"id":"2370414","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Marida, now a prisoner of the Federation, tells Banagher to keep on saying, \"Even so...\" She says that he has the power to awaken another system that sleeps within the Unicorn Gundam.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-05-22","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/x5URIOw1dRCskqQVz9NwzJhAslp.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/x5URIOw1dRCskqQVz9NwzJhAslp.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/67524/season/1/episode/8"},{"id":"2370415","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Episodio 9","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The Unicorn Gundam reaches the wreckage of Laplace, and the La+ Program's seal is broken. A speech given 96 years earlier by Ricardo Marcenas, the first prime minister of the Earth Federation government, begins playing back.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-05-29","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fJ8xchQqRF9qyw8VP7cwPBFvvpc.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fJ8xchQqRF9qyw8VP7cwPBFvvpc.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/67524/season/1/episode/9"},{"id":"2370416","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"After saving Banagher and the Unicorn Gundam, which were falling toward Earth, the Garencieres crash-lands in the Western Sahara. Meanwhile, Zeon remnants who have been hiding on Earth launch an attack on the Earth Federation capital.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-06-05","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qwJPKfXiS4px1D7Ssotlj3URa5a.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qwJPKfXiS4px1D7Ssotlj3URa5a.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/67524/season/1/episode/10"},{"id":"2370417","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"As they cross the desert, Banagher learns of Zinnerman's tragic past, and how his family were killed by the Federation Forces. He decides to head for the Torrington base, where new information will be disclosed.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-06-12","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5zvdpshf1OjdM2zaZsQnLIz5ffh.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5zvdpshf1OjdM2zaZsQnLIz5ffh.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/67524/season/1/episode/11"