/1/episode/14"},{"id":"2370421","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":15,"title":{"value":"Episodio 15","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"With Banagher, Mineva, and the others aboard, the Garencieres takes off for space. It suffers engine trouble en route, but Banagher refuses to give up.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-07-24","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ijGXuT77JXWpveayyhKtUWgE2uH.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ijGXuT77JXWpveayyhKtUWgE2uH.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/67524/season/1/episode/15"},{"id":"2370422","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":16,"title":{"value":"Episodio 16","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Now on the run from the Federation Forces, the Nahel Argama has taken the desperate step of forming a joint front with the Sleeves.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-07-31","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/plMYIXThTpTcg6u0Akp7ef27spD.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/plMYIXThTpTcg6u0Akp7ef27spD.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/67524/season/1/episode/16"},{"id":"2370423","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":17,"title":{"value":"Episodio 17","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Banagher is despondent now that Full Frontal has learned the final coordinates to Laplace's Box. Marida encourages him, saying that his chance will come if he holds onto his dreams.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-08-07","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cqs3zWUQI5fUJ6aQfSwc7SI8yUy.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cqs3zWUQI5fUJ6aQfSwc7SI8yUy.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/67524/season/1/episode/17"},{"id":"2370424","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":18,"title":{"value":"Episodio 18","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"As the Nahel Argama rushes toward Industrial 7, its course is blocked by Sleeves mobile suits. Unless it can break through the enemy lines, Full Frontal will be allowed to obtain Laplace's Box.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-08-14","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/olV4uU1EvgUV8PL6uZu4mOAwnBH.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/olV4uU1EvgUV8PL6uZu4mOAwnBH.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/67524/season/1/episode/18"},{"id":"2370425","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":19,"title":{"value":"Episodio 19","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Banagher struggles against the psycho-jammers of Angelo's Rozen Zulu. Meanwhile, as Riddhe confronts Marida, he is overwhelmed by a thought resonance phenomenon and destroys the Kshatriya Repaired.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-08-21","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aX0PsAiM5kb7X5eiPY0ykvMJJ15.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aX0PsAiM5kb7X5eiPY0ykvMJJ15.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/67524/season/1/episode/19"},{"id":"2370426","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":20,"title":{"value":"Episodio 20","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Banagher's great-grandfather Syam Vist has been waiting for him and Mineva at Magallanica.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-08-28","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/d00743DBU6gWmfeXAPz0b6PqeNu.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/d00743DBU6gWmfeXAPz0b6PqeNu.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/67524/season/1/episode/20"},{"id":"2370428","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":21,"title":{"value":"Episodio 21","language":"